sequenceDiagram
participant M as Main
participant F as KioskFacade
participant I as StockService
participant P as PriceCalculator
participant PF as PaymentMethodFactory
participant G as PaymentGateway
participant L as TransactionLog
participant E as EventPublisher
M->>F: checkout(order, type, promotion)
F->>I: isAvailable(quantities)
F->>P: finalTotal(order, promotion)
F->>PF: create(type)
F->>G: process(method, total)
F->>L: record(method, total, approved)
F->>I: reduceStock(quantities)
F->>E: publish(SaleEvent)
E-->>M: SalesDashboard.onEvent
F-->>M: CheckoutResult
